Hi Yumiko,

I've attached the 16 questions our partner sales desk has collected for Octob=
er to December. They are separate requests, not a count of customers or sites.

Could we separate the question of when Site Board might be available at all s=
ites from what we can already explain about recurring requests in Patrol Chec=
k? In particular, our desk needs to know where someone starts, what they shou=
ld review, and what to say if they cannot open the earlier request. We don't =
want to imply a rollout date or an access change before you have confirmed ei=
ther.

Would you have time on 9 September to go through the list together? After tha=
t, please let us know what we can take into calls and what needs more work.

Thank you,
Nathan


